return response.choices[0].message.content;`,language:"typescript"},relatedChecks:["AUT-003","REL-001"]},{id:"DAT-004",name:"Vector Store & Context Retention TTL Boundaries",category:"data",severity:"medium",summary:"Persistent vector stores, conversation memory, and embedding caches must enforce explicit time-to-live (TTL) limits and tenant purge procedures.",detectionLogic:"Preflight checks vector collections and conversation cache stores for missing TTL expiration properties or missing user data deletion routines.",rationale:"Unbounded retention of agent conversational history and retrieved embeddings accumulates sensitive customer records indefinitely, violating data privacy regulations and expanding the attack surface for vector extraction.",frameworkMappings:{nistSp80053:["MP-6 (Media Sanitization)","SI-12 (Information Management and Retention)"],nistAiRmf:["MAP 1.5 (Data Provenance & Retention)","GOVERN 1.2"],owaspLlm:["LLM02: Sensitive Information Disclosure"],cwe:["CWE-459: Incomplete Cleanup","CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information"]},remediationExample:{badDescription:"Vector records and conversation embeddings retained permanently without TTL:",badCode:`// Embeddings stored indefinitely with no TTL or purge routine
await vectorIndex.upsert({
  id: docId,
  values: embeddingVector,
  metadata: { tenantId, userQuery }
});`,goodDescription:"Enforce explicit expiration TTL and customer purge capability:",goodCode:`// Enforce explicit 30-day retention TTL and partition by tenant
